  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">KIC, Kristdemokratiskt Internationellt Center Demokratist&#xf6;d PAO 2023-27</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">KIC, The Christian Democratic International Center, PAO-strategy - KIC, The Christian Democratic International Center, PAO-strategy - Mandatstyrt</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">M&#xe5;len f&#xf6;r insatsen &#xe4;r;
-&#xf6;kad demokratisk representation, &#xf6;kat deltagande och inflytande f&#xf6;r unga kvinnor och m&#xe4;n inom politiken, som &#xe4;mnar fr&#xe4;mja b&#xe4;ttre levnadsvillkor f&#xf6;r m&#xe4;nniskorna i programl&#xe4;nderna.
-att ungdomars och kvinnliga fullm&#xe4;ktigeledam&#xf6;ters effektiva deltagande och inflytande p&#xe5; lokal myndighetsniv&#xe5; har &#xf6;kat, samt; 
-f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttrad kapacitet hos politiska akt&#xf6;rer med demokratiska v&#xe4;rderingar genom att &#xf6;ka deras representativitet och f&#xf6;rm&#xe5;ga att samordna krafter f&#xf6;r att m&#xf6;ta demokratiska utmaningar.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aims for the contribution are;
-increased democratic representation, participation and influence of young women and men within politics, who aim to promote better living conditions for the people in the programme countries;
-that the effective participation and influence of  youth and women councillors in local government level has increased, and; 
-improved capabilities of politcial actors committed to democratic values by increasing their representativeness and capacity to coordinate forces to face democratic challenges.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">M&#xe5;len f&#xf6;r insatsen &#xe4;r;
1.Increased democratic representation, participation and influence of young women and men within politics, that aim to promote better living conditions for the people in the programme countries;
2. The effective participation and influence of LCV (LC5) youth and women councillors in local government level has increased
3 Improve the capabilities of political actors committed to democratic values by increasing their representativeness and capacity to coordinate forces to face democratic challenges in the region
4 To improve the capabilities of sister parties and political organisations to increase their internal democracy, promote dialogue with other like-minded actors, and increase their capacity to formulate more inclusive policies</narrative>
  </description>
